WEBVTT

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:39.450
So anyway, the old school building is set to be demolished.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.950
It could collapse at any time, so be sure to stay away!

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.750
Ranmaru!

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.910
What?

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.330
Do you have anything after school?

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.790
Want to go to karaoke with us?

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.000
It can be your welcoming party!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.590
That sounds great! Though, could you stop referring to me like I'm a guy?

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.760
It sounds cooler, though!

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.010
Oh, okay. All right, then!

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.930
Hey, Sakura! You come too!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.930
Uh, well... You see, Rindou—

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.900
Oh, come on! No need to be so polite! We're friends, aren't we?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.690
Well, you seem to think so...

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.860
All right! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.900
I already know which song I want to sing!

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.950
Sounds good! You come too, Binbouda!

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.950
Oh please, just call me Momiji!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.070
Hey, wait a second!

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.990
These guys can come too, right?

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.950
Binbouda is all right, but...

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.710
Sakura is...

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.920
Oh, don't say that.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.710
It's all right, Rindou.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.920
Don't worry about little old me.
Just go have fun with everyone else.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.340
I've got more important things to spend my time on than karaoke.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.930
You heard her. Let's go.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.180
Uh, okay...

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.220
I'll hold your bag!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.100
You don't bother with stuff like karaoke, right, Miss Sakura?

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.770
Ranmaru! Hurry!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.610
Bucchimoni.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.360
They're ancient!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.240
There's this new store by the station that's really good!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.860
Fuckin' Tittyko... Who does she think she is?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.790
I'm so moved...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.250
Binbouda is amazing!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.550
Ranmaru, you sing too!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.010
Uh, yeah...

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.260
What's wrong?

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.260
Well...

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.760
You really didn't want Sakura to come?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.640
Oh, is that it?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.980
She's better off with her boy-toys.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.440
She always looks so smug whenever she's surrounded by that lot.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.440
She only ever talked to me once, and even that was like, "I have no desire to associate with women."

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.070
I was flat-out rejected!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:44.490
But still... Don't you think she looks really lonely sometimes?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:48.490
You've seen Sakura like that?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.370
No way! I can't even imagine that!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.540
Are you concerned about Ichiko?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.880
I don't know... I'm awkward with this kind of stuff.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.340
But I can't just turn a blind eye to these things.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.510
How about I just tell it to you straight?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.180
About Sakura? She said she had better things to do, right?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.390
She's probably just counting the strands in her tatami mats.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.930
You serious?

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.930
12,206...

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.810
12,207...

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.560
Told ya!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.270
The hell you doin'?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.110
Don't just barge in here without asking!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.400
Get a hold of yourself, Sakura! You look pathetic!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.110
If something's wrong, just tell me!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.990
My dear, it looks like my breasts have gotten bigger again.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.870
Why, you... You braggin' now?!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.620
I didn't say anything!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.620
So I guess this is the normal Sakura.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.580
Easy to tease, right?

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.370
Shut your trap!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.670
So? What do you want?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.670
To have fun!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.510
What do you mean, "to have fun?"

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.670
Do we need a special reason to go hang out at a friend's house?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.300
Friend?

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.970
You're all gonna love this movie I rented! The Seven Samurai!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.520
Aww, what about Dorifu?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.560
No way! We're watching Kurosawa!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.440
But this is really funny!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.650
Take it outside!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.940
What? You don't like movies?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:58.900
That's not it!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.360
What's wrong with you?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.780
Then... W-W-W...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.820
Wanna share love stories?!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.110
Like hell I do!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.410
Yeah! Love stories!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:08.700
Huh?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.780
Or, for short...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.540
L!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.500
All right! Ranmaru, you go first!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.910
Huh?! Me?!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:18.330
Well, I... Uh...

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.170
No way! My lips are sealed! Like, totally!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.760
Aw, shit! Now I'm giggling like a schoolgirl!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.840
Take it outside!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.600
Anyway, Rindou. I don't recall ever becoming friends with you.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:34.980
What're you talking about? You even fought my dad for my sake!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:38.520
That was just because he pissed me off.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.940
It wasn't really for your sake or anything.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.150
Either way, I still owe you one.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:48.530
So, if you're ever in any trouble, just let me know.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.410
I'll do anything I can to help you.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.160
Uh... Okay, okay.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.330
I understand.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.550
Guess I gotta be direct in order to get it through that thick skull of yours.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.920
To put it bluntly, you're a nuisance.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:10.930
Having riff-raff like you around would tarnish my reputation.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:14.060
We live in totally different worlds, anyway.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.430
I trust from tomorrow there'll be no more—

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.190
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.810
What? It's not coming off!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.770
That hurt, dammit! The hell d'you think you're doing?!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.490
Well... I just thought you might've been wearing a mask or something.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.620
You practically wrote the book on lying, cheating, being a hypocrite and so on...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:36.620
So I thought I'd just take your stupid pride and try to rip it off like a mask.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.670
Get the fuck out!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.880
Stop bothering me!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.510
Maybe I said too much.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.380
I think you hit a nerve.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.220
How do you mean?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.260
A painful memory.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.890
Really?

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.720
Are you really human?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.930
Do you know anything about that?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.930
Dunno. I'm not really interested, anyway.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.980
Oh. But I see...

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.100
Does it bother you?

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.690
Yeah, but I'm not good with this kind of stuff.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.940
Is that so?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:10.150
Then I'll give you this.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.580
Gadget of Misfortune: Trauma Stethoscope!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:21.290
With this, you can hear a person's deepest secrets; the things they've locked away in their hearts!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.830
Amazing...

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.210
Wait a sec, what's a "Gadget of Misfortune"?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.420
Oh, right. I'm actually a God of Misfortune.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.170
Oh.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:29.670
<i>Can I use this?</i>

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:33.840
<i>Sakura's never gonna tell me herself, that's for sure...</i>

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:37.890
<i>No, I can't! I can't rely on tools!</i>

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.230
That Tittyko seriously pisses me off.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.360
Can't believe we got stuck in the same class as her two years in a row.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.860
Seriously.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.110
Well, then.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.360
How about we get serious for once?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.370
Sakura sure is late...

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:01.370
Is she still there? What is she <i>thinking</i>?

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.380
She's been trying to get all buddy-buddy this whole day...

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.500
Yo, Sakura! Let's have lunch together!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.250
Can you tell me the answer to this question?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.130
You laying in wait or something?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.930
Poor Rindou, getting the cold shoulder like that.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:15.800
And you are?

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:20.060
Tange Akane. The least you could do is
remember your classmates' names, you know.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.060
What do you want?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:25.190
I'll help you out. We classmates gotta look out for each other, yeah?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.060
Oh dear...

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:31.610
Who does she think she is, some
oblivious middle school student?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.240
Oh?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.740
Oh, oh.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.240
Oh, oh, oh.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:41.540
Commissioner Teddy, please come in.
We'll need to activate the Bat-Signal.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:43.910
Oi, Akane!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.670
You sure about this?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.290
I told you, it's fine.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.250
She's had this coming for a long time.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.970
Hey, isn't this going a bit too far?

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.340
What are you saying?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:00.930
If we can put Tittyko in her place, it'll make our lives just that little bit easier.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.600
Well, in that case... I'll help myself.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.730
What? What was that?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.150
A sandal from outside?

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.520
A sandal? It can't be!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:20.160
Cradling loneliness behind a mask, compassion for a budding friend.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.160
A kindred heart transformed into fighting spirit.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.170
A dancing, falling smile bursting into cherry blossoms.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.250
Rindou Ranmaru! At your service!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.710
Ri-Rindou?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.340
Don't fuck with me! You think you're gonna get awa—

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.390
What's with her?!

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:40.680
Why, you!

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.600
Huh?

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.770
Chew on this!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.200
You two, listen up!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.490
Take those guys and get the fuck out of here!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.530
Sir! Yes, sir!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.620
Sakura? You all right?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.290
Huh? When did she...

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.460
So you three were behind this?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.880
Using guys to get revenge isn't very ladylike.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.550
This doesn't involve you!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:22.720
That's not true. We're classmates, after all. Let's try and get along.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.430
Huh?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.890
What's this?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.740
<i>There goes Rindou, just doing whatever she pleases. I would've woken up in a few minutes anyway.</i>

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:41.620
<i>Well, whatever. Now we're even, so maybe she'll get out of my hair already.</i>

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.370
<i>This... is what I want.</i>

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.880
Wait a second, what—

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.880
<i>It could collapse at any time, so be sure to stay away!</i>

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.220
Rindou!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.780
Wh-What the hell are you doing?!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.240
Why are you trying to save us?!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:29.620
I don't know... I moved on instinct.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:33.880
Look over there. That path probably leads to the hallway, so hurry up and get outta here!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.500
What about you?!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.500
I said, get outta here!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.510
You!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.970
What happened to Rindou?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:44.930
I don't know.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.560
What do you mean, you don't know?! Is she still inside?

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.560
Shut up! I don't know anything!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:57.070
I'll do anything I can to help you.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.860
You moron! You got into this mess because of your own stupid sense of duty to your "friends"!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.080
All you did was hurt yourself!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.660
I'm not gonna save you, you know! I'm fed up with this!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.790
I don't care who owes who! I'm not gonna put myself in that position!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.330
Just hearing that pisses you off, right?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.710
Why don't you just come out here and set me straight?!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.210
All right?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.420
If you want to save her, just go.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:24.640
Wh-What are you saying? There's no way I'd do that.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.350
Is that so?

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:31.890
Sounds to me like <i>you're</i> the one hurting over that "stupid sense of duty."

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.230
What's with you and that know-it-all tone?!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.610
If you do nothing, Ranmaru will die.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:46.120
But if I save her here... she'll come back to me again.. and then I'll...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.200
Oh? This <i>is</i> surprising.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.370
Could it be that you're afraid of getting close to people?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.790
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.630
What the hell do you know?!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.000
Nothing much, really.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.340
You don't know <i>anything</i> about me!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.090
You're right. I don't know anything.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:09.260
I don't... I don't want this...

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.600
Hey, it's Valentine's Day soon!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.230
Have you decided who you're going to give chocolate to?

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:19.610
Yusuke, I think. He's the nicest of the boys.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:24.570
I knew it. I was actually thinking of Yusuke too.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.610
You too, Kurumi?

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:29.320
Aw, I'll have no chance against you, though.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.580
Th-That's not true!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:34.580
Really? Then let's give him our chocolate together!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.040
Huh?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.250
It wouldn't be fair for one of us
to have a head start, right?

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.210
We're friends, aren't we?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.130
Y-Yeah.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.880
Okay then, let's give them to him together!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.970
Sakura, um, this is for you.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.350
That's pretty cute!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.360
This?

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.980
It's so nice! I wish I had one!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.740
Can I have it? Please?

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.490
S-Sorry, not this...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>It was from Yusuke...</i>

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.660
Oh. It's more important than your dear friend's request, I see.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.750
Fine, then! Starting tomorrow, I'm not talking to you anymore!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.090
No! Kurumi!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.000
Wait!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.680
Cute.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:33.180
That's right! I was thinking of confessing to Yusuke.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.140
B-But Kurumi—

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.390
I've made up my mind.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:40.270
And I want your blessing, Ichiko!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.400
So please pray for my success!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.650
We're friends, right?

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.820
Without my friends, I'd be all alone... So...

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:55.290
God, please let Kurumi and Yusuke get along well.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.830
Sorry. I like Ichiko.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.670
Oh, Yusuke, that's so sad.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.630
You know that brooch you gave Ichiko?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:12.850
She said she didn't want a cheap toy like that, and gave it to me!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:13.890
Huh?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.430
Oh, good morning!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:30.200
I don't know what it is that torments you right now,

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.240
nor do I know the cause.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.490
I only know what I've noticed recently.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.580
I don't want to admit it,

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.460
but whenever I see you in low spirits, I don't know what to do.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.040
So what?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.330
So...

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.380
Stop being such a friggin' coward!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:52.680
Go for it, Ichiko!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.060
You're your own worst enemy.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:02.440
If your worries and doubts torment you, then just stop thinking about them.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:10.570
There you go, acting all high and mighty again!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.570
Pretty rich, coming from someone so poor!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.030
Aren't we predictable? Oh, there we go.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.830
Stay still!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.330
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:21.910
All done.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.790
I told you, that hurts like shit!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.840
You'll feel better soon!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.630
Like hell I will!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.340
This?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:35.840
Decide for yourself, here and now. What you should do, and what you want for yourself.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:40.850
Empty your mind of meaningless thoughts, and follow your true feelings.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.270
I don't think I can hold out much longer.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.110
Am I gonna die in a place like this?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.030
Huh?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.320
What's a mouse doin' here?

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.450
What? A snake, too?!

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.240
'Sup?

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.250
S-Sakura?!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.960
Why are you inside a snake?

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.870
Wait, didn't you escape?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.630
You'll die if you stay here!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.500
What is this— It's pretty good!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.590
So Fortune tastes good, eh?

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.930
How're you feeling? Better?

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.970
Better? How could I get better so—

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.600
Huh? Now that you mention it...

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.100
All right. Let's get out of here.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.100
A monkey this time?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.900
And how are we gonna do that?

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.400
We'll crush everything in our way!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.400
Now you're speakin' my language!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.040
Rindou Ranmaru! Back in action!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.460
Looks like I owe you one again!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:50.540
Hey...

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.260
How can I get you to leave me alone?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:59.680
If that's what you really want, I will.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:04.430
But why won't you allow anyone to get close to you?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.600
Did something... happen?

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.190
How did you...

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:14.610
Well, Momiji mentioned something along those lines.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.700
There she goes, meddling again...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.030
Also, there's this.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:19.780
What is it?

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:20.950
Momiji gave it to me.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:25.000
"If you use this, you'll be able to see into Sakura's heart," she said.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:32.960
If you don't want to talk about the past, you don't have to force yourself.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:38.090
But when I said I wanted to help you, I meant it.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:43.100
If... If you ever decide you can trust me,

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.770
I'd like to use that...

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.900
Huh? Are you sure?

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.560
If you don't want to listen, you don't have to.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:55.320
N-No, I want to! I want to know more about you!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:01.820
Oh, really? You mean you planned that from the very beginning?

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:07.200
You guys suck at this. It's much better to get close to your enemies first.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.000
If you say, "We're friends, right?" then she'll do anything for you!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.090
Good morning, Ichiko! You can have this thing back.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.470
Yusuke said he'd buy me something much nicer.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.260
I guess I was a bit selfish befo—

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:20.970
I don't want it.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:21.720
Huh?

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.720
<i>I've... had enough of this.</i>

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.720
What?

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:31.560
I said, I don't want a cheap toy like that!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:39.740
Don't pity me. It's human nature to be jealous.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:43.370
You just need to be strong enough to withstand that jealousy.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.330
And that's why you never make friends?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.660
"Friends"? That's just a word!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.790
Give me a break! Everyone just puts on a façade!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.090
No one's ever tried to get to know the real me!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:00.130
I don't give a shit about people like that!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.840
That's why I only think about myself!

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:08.390
You're the same. One day, you'll decide to use me.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.480
I would never!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.100
That's easy to say.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.440
Then why did you tell me about your past?

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.940
Isn't it because you never wanted to feel like that again?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:23.450
Isn't it because you don't want me to turn out like Kurumi?!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.120
That's—

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:29.200
I promise I will never betray you! I <i>vow</i> it!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.580
No... You will.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.080
I won't!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:33.830
You will.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.080
I won't!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:35.630
You will.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:36.330
I won't!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.710
I said you will!

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.840
I said I won't!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.590
You will! You will! You will! You will! You will!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.340
I won't! I won't! I won't! I won't! I won't!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.180
You will!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.850
You will... You definitely will.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.850
I won't... ever.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.140
Believe me.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.990
R-Really?

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.450
You really won't?

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.070
Yeah. I won't.

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:53.810
Let's hit the karaoke, Sakura!

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:55.470
Why me?

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:57.770
Ooh! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.900
Look here, Rindou... Just 'cos of what happened yesterday, don't go thinking—

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.400
Oh, please! Seriously! Just call me Ranmaru!

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:07.320
Come on, hurry up!

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:09.700
It's much more fun than counting tatami strands, I assure you.

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:10.910
You shut up!

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:13.410
Hey, Ranmaru...

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:16.410
You... You can...

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:19.120
You can call me...

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:20.250
by my first name too.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.380
Let's go, Ichiko!

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:26.670
You can call me "Momiji," too!

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:29.010
You shut the fuck up, beggar bitch!

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:31.220
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga!</i>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:34.890
Thanks for watching again this week, everyone! Listen to my fast voice! This week I'm here!
